=== briefing NSheriff_about
About the work of a craftsman
#show Hero2
#show NSheriff
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 1
Hello friend, are you here for the first time?
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero2 2
Yes, and can you see it that way? 
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 3
And because we happen to have a fairly closed society, not...
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero2 4
Society?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 5
Specifically, society. 
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 6
A scientist said this, when I was still making him these thin scissors, and something he called scalpels, that and I remembered.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero2 7
So you're a blacksmith, right?
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 8
No. I am not a blacksmith but a craftsman. They call me Arhar.  
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero2 9
And what kind of artisan are you and why do you work here?
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 10
I'm a craftsman making all kinds of clever little things that scientific people need for experiments or whatever. And I make guns, I have to live for something. And why here? Because there's nowhere else, it's not convenient for the masters of magic that there's anyone but them, the masters.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 0
#phrase NSheriff 11
Also, if you need anything, come on over and I'll do it.
=== briefing NSheriff_talk
Say...
#show Hero 1
#show NSheriff
#phrase Hero 1
I have some questions...
#phrase NSheriff 2
Of course, ask away!
=== briefing brief_0
Hi! My name is...
#DESC + automatically
#show Hero
#show First
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
What luck! This man may be able to help me...
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 9 
#phrase First 2
Boy! Where do you think you're going, trying to get bitten by armadillos? You know what, sitting in this dry-throated hollow is boring, I don't even have a drop of wine left!
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
He took me for someone else. The most important thing is that he doesn't guess who I really am.
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Hero 4
Well, I got a little lost...
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 9 
#phrase First 5
Boy, don't fret. You're incredibly lucky. There's no use sitting here waiting for a job. I know someone who hires young men temporarily, we can send you there.
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Hero 6
I agree.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9 
#phrase First 7
You're doing me a favor too... As if you had a choice. Keep your papers and walk down the road, thanks to them the guards will let you through. Once you get to the camp, show the papers, people will help you through the Portal. Before you go to Suslanger. Although... the climate there is such that you can't help it, and there are a lot of soldiers.
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Hero 8
I can handle it. I'll visit you again if I need to.
#ANIMATION 46
#CAMERA 9 
#phrase First 9
You all say that... And then they go off to die under the table in the first better joint.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Hero 10
This is not the kind of thing I've been through before. But thanks for the warning, I'll be careful.
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 9 
#phrase First 11
We're talking... Okay, tell the camp to send me a couple of barrels of wine. I'm not gonna drink water!
=== briefing brief_1
Trying to justify yourself
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show HWLeader 
#ANIMATION 59
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
Sir! Mr. Warden! Please listen to me!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase HWLeader 2
Shut up! In what tone do you address Hartweik, an imperial officer! I'd have you flogged if it weren't for the few coins you can get for your strange skin!
#animation 61
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
Forgive me, noble sir, but there's been a mistake! I should not be here...
#animation 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase HWLeader 4
Ha, ha, ha! If you only knew how many slaves I hear that phrase from! Don't waste my time...
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 11
#phrase HWLeader 5
Hmm... actually some strange skin color.... AND there was some ad where it said a red youngster had snuck into the scientists' mansion. I'll write where I need to, that I have him - and I'll win a prize!
#animation 44
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 6
But, Officer! Humbly, please hear me out. This is a mistake!
#animation 62
#CAMERA 11
#phrase HWLeader 7
How dare you! A mistake!!! You unlawfully broke into Suslanger province without documents! Only a suspicious letter of recommendation was found with you! You should be thankful that you weren't tortured on the spot! Tfu -and that I'm talking to you at all!
#animation 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 8
For that, of course... thank you...
#animation 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase HWLeader 9
Get out of my sight! And pray to your wild idols that you live to at least the next morning! Ha, ha, ha, ha!
=== briefing brief_101
Get to know the chief 
#DESC
#show Hero
#show OrcC
#show merc2
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcC 1
My warriors have seen that you from the Dead-Dead city have come. There the living-living did not. Where did you come from?
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
We have come from another land. Here is an expedition of the Khadagan Empire that we should find and hand over a packet with orders.
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 0
#phrase OrcC 3
Uhr-rrr...
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 4
Kir, your words made too much of an impression on him. Because he obviously understood everything about it.
#ANIMATION 66
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 5
We search the camp for aliens who wear iron armor and are looking for something here. Do you know where they are?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcC 6
Orcs don't like aliens. We killed them, we smashed the camp. Ah, it was fun and merry! No more aliens on Gipath.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 7
Ah, yes! And what, there's nothing left of them? Did anyone even survive?
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase OrcC 8
No. My warriors-warriors in the camp destroyed everything. One chest-cuff remains, iron, strong, the key at the ogre's lies. He helped us. Good ogre.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 9
Kiel would advise you to remember this. There might be something useful in that trunk. You'd just have to steal the key from the ogre.
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 10
And look, you're a brave, bold and savvy warrior. Surely you can help us in our quest.
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 11
#phrase OrcC 11
I am the chief of my-my tribe. I Urk-Tar. I the most powerful chief on Gipath. Only Shei-var more-more me, but he is far-away, in the Sands.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcC 12
Ah, now I will-be like Shei-var. The Chosen One helped him. Now with me the Chosen One will be. He will help the tribe. It will be good.
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 13
What seems to be the story with this Chosen One? But if the chief will let me tame Gipath here, one might agree to help his tribe. 
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 14
My name is Kir, and my child's name is Kiel. We agree to help your tribe, and we hope you will help us too.
=== briefing brief_102
Get to know the clairvoyant
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcPyr
#show merc2
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcPyr 1
Tyn-Achei didn't call you. What did he come for?  
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
I just came to get acquainted. My name is Kir, and the girl with me is Kiel. We had already gotten acquainted with the chief, so we decided to talk to the shaman too.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcPyr 3
Clairvoyant- clairvoyant protects the spirit of the tribe, protects the strength. Clairvoyant strong-strong-the tribe lives. Strangers come and destroy everything-destroy everything. Tyn-Achei does not like aliens-aliens.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero 4
The chief received us very well. It seemed to me that he was speaking for the whole tribe.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 0
#phrase OrcPyr 5
Urk-Tar is a strong chief, wise-wise. The clairvoyant should not have argued-argued with the chief. You will come, then you will go. The clairvoyant and the chief always-will be.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 6
You guessed correctly. I won't stay here for long. But you don't have to spoil your contact with the chief because of me. Don't be afraid, I won't do your tribe any harm, on the contrary, if help is needed, I'll be happy to help.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcPyr 7
Man, you well-wishers speak well. But I will-will look behind you. Watch without ceasing.
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 8
And I'll- I'll watch that you're not only clairvoyant, but you're tinkering with magic!
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase OrcPyr 9
The clairvoyant and the chief always-will do everything themselves for the tribe-tribe. An axe then-when strong, if the chief made it, and the clairvoyant gave it strength.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 10
Well, will you do something for us?  
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 0
#phrase OrcPyr 11
As long as you help the tribe, we will.
=== briefing brief_103
About the newcomers on Gipath
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcC
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
Urk-Tar, I want to ask you something. Have any other aliens appeared here besides the ones you already told about?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcC 2
No, we killed-all of them. Shei-Var thought-thought they were demons. Clad in iron, weapons of iron. Invincible demons. But the Chosen One demon-demon killed. Urk-Tar thought: the Chosen-She-Var could, that means the strong-strong orc will be able to too.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 3
And who is this Chosen One you keep talking about?
#CAMERA 0
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase OrcC 4
The Chosen One is the Chosen One! He came-from nowhere, the people called him the Chosen One. He helped people, he helped Shei-Var. Then he was lost. The people became evil, attacked the orcs, drove them from the Foothills. Completely evil.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
Wait. What do you mean it came out of nowhere?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcC 6
They say-they say he appeared in the ruins when nothing-nothing was there, and then-then the Chosen One appeared. Out of nowhere.
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 7
Well, there you go! Surely the Chosen One has teleported to Gipath. That means he's the Joon I'm looking for.
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 8
And where is the Chosen One now?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcC 9
Orcs-orcs don't know. He was looking for something-he was looking for something. Then the abyss. With certainty-with certainty, he found.
#CAMERA 10
#ANIMATION 9
#phrase Hero 10
If there's a chance that the Chosen One is still here, you should try to find him.
=== briefing brief_104
On how things are going
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 1
So what do you think of all this?
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 11
#phrase merc2 2
Well, you look much nicer without those nasty cloths on your face. I'm glad you finally took it off. And the chief's mouth is so bad, and his skin is so green. Horror, in a word!
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
That's not what I mean! What are we supposed to do now? After all, the camp is gone, the khadananian is gone, and where to look for our Joon - no one knows!
#ANIMATION 70
#CAMERA 11
#phrase merc2 4
Dear Kira, it seems to me that you have forgotten that your faithful friend Kiel is with you. Above all we must do so that no one on Suslanger begins to suspect that the expedition no longer exists.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
Right! We must prepare a report, and as ordered, give it to the messenger who will come for it.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 0
#phrase merc2 6
Yes, and once you can be unconcerned about the arrival of a new crowd of Khadagan soldiers in shining armor, we will proceed to look for your friend.
=== briefing brief_105
On the life of orcs
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcC
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
Chief, we have been living in your camp for some time now. We don't want to be a burden to you. Maybe we could help with something, do something useful?
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 2
Kir, speak for yourself. I feel good here and I'm not tired of any remorse.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcC 3
Man-to-man wants to help the orc! But strangely! You good-guy. For now you are our guest-guest. If you want to become like us - a true warrior-warrior, you should-get a battle axe.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero 4
Okay. And where do I get this axe?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcC 5
The axe-the axe the clairvoyant makes. And you stone-stone you bring. When the stone is good the axe is good too, and the warrior is mighty. The best stone is in the Dead city-town.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero 6
Perfect. In that case, we'll go to the Dead City for the best stone.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 7
And didn't you forget that we also have to return the stone patterns with the report? You're not going to send the best ones to Suslanger, are you? I would suggest the other way around, which is to look for the worst and somewhere else, such as here in Distant Peaks.
=== briefing brief_106
About the report to Suslanger
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show merc2
#show Paper 5
#show SackBabur 3
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 64
#phrase merc2 1
I won't say it was easy, but we made it! We already have everything we need for the Suslanger shipment.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
Yeah, all that's left is to get it all back to that dilapidated cabin in the Dead City. The sergeant told us they use it to relay reports.
#ANIMATION 14
