#phrase Hero 3
Thank you Kiel for then suggesting where to pick the stone samples from. I wouldn't have guessed without you. You're my best friend, although I have to admit I never had friends before.
#hide Paper 5
#hide SackBabur 3
#ANIMATION 72
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 11
#phrase merc2 4
A friend, a friend! Why does he only see me as a friend! I followed him to this Gipath forgotten by everyone just to be near him and he won't notice any of it!
#ANIMATION 46
#CAMERA 0
#phrase merc2 5
Be that as it may, for a pleaser like you Kiel will invent more than one good idea. That's what friends are for.
=== briefing brief_107
About the axe material
#DESC 
#show Hero 
