But Tyn-Achei knows-what to do with your stone-you can do. I'll make you beads, almost like an orc-woman you'll be!
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 7
What a fab... Thank you-thank you!
=== briefing brief_108
On the chief's absence
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcPyr
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
And where is the leader lost? I look at it this way, some warriors are gone too.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcPyr 2
The chieftain for the hunt-hunt is gone. To the mountains to the east. There hunting-hunting good, animals many-many, birds many-many. Long gone, long gone.
#ANIMATION 70
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 3
Has he been gone a long time? Kir, you know what, I think there's something wrong with this. And Kiel has a nose for such things!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 4
Yeah, you're right. It's strange that the chief hasn't returned from the hunt so far, especially since the terrain there is good and the hunt should be a success.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcPyr 5
If you follow the chief, strong-strong the tribe will do well. Tribe-tribe without a chief weak, all may offend him. When Urk-Tar returns it will be at once-at once-good.
=== briefing brief_109
On the gratitude of the chief
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcC
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
I'm so glad we got here just in time. It's strange that the harpy attacked you. Judging by everything it wasn't her territory.
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 0
#phrase OrcC 2
The young orc dumbfounded. He wanted to kill a harpy-harp. Alone! She's strong, the first-first to go. You're a brash warrior, the chief you saved. Great warrior! Urk-Tar is grateful to you.
=== briefing brief_11
On the impact of the accident
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show Elder
#show DragonPoison 5
#CAMERA 10
#ANIMATION 12
#phrase Hero 1
Rindeil, just as you guessed, I managed everything with ease.
#ANIMATION 58
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Elder 2
Well, that's it, and that's how you experienced it. Now you can breathe easy, all your worries behind you.
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 3
No, it's not all over yet. I still attract too much attention because of my skin color. Something needs to be figured out, and the sooner the better.
#ANIMATION 59
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Elder 4
Yes, you have to think. Hm... There is one measure... The venom of Prettnotulius sackbutus has been shown to affect the color of the skin, turning it gray, but in doing so it causes convulsions or paralysis of the limbs. Well, every remedy has side effects, you understand. But in my opinion it would be useful to give up this remedy and come up with something else...
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 5
That's right, we'd better leave it for a moment of desperation. Anyway thanks for the suggestion....
=== briefing brief_110
About the goblin invasion
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcPyr
#show merc2
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcPyr 1
The clairvoyant wise, then, and knows-knows. A tribe without a chief is weak-weak, his even goblins-goblins are not afraid.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 2
So what? Why are you just cracking misery?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcPyr 3
The misfortune-unhappiness has already crept up. Evil-evil goblins have crept up, lots and lots. They saw that the chief-chief was gone, they came-to rob us. They took a lot of goods. They frightened the children.
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 4
As far as I can see, everyone's okay, which is the most important thing. And you'll still get the goods.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 9
#phrase OrcPyr 5
They took Urk-Tar's wife. Urk-Tar will be strong-willed.
#ANIMATION 70
#CAMERA 5
#phrase merc2 6
I doubt if he will be strongly evil. Judging by what I've heard about his wife, I think he'll even be happy about it. Should I go make him happy?
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase OrcPyr 7
You're saying it wrong. A chief guards his wife-wife as he guards his-her tribe. He will throw-away his wife, that is to say, a wicked-wicked chief.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 8
But after all, Urk-Tar is injured now, and he can't go save anyone. Eh, I guess we'll have to set out again. First we save the chief, then we save his wife. Agreed, but I hope none of his relatives are planning to get into trouble.
=== briefing brief_111
About the rescued chief's wife
#show Hero
#show OrcC
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
