What are you looking at me for! We gave you back your wife and now you can't marry anyone else! And I'll already make sure your wife is all right! Look at him, the 'man-girl' has taken a liking to him!
=== briefing brief_112
About the people on Gipath
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcC
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 1
You told me that there are humans living on Gipath as well, but I haven't seen any so far.
#CAMERA 0
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcC 2
We fight. The people of the Village-Village attacked the orcs on the Foothills. A second village was created. The orcs are gone. Only the hunters remain.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 3
Who are the hunters again?
#CAMERA 0
#ANIMATION 7
#phrase OrcC 4
Also people-people, but they live not with them, but with orcs they make friends.
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
What if I wanted to meet the hunters?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase OrcC 6
Not allowed. The people in the Middle Peaks have come-come. The orcs continue to drive them out. They must be stopped.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 7
And what do you propose? That I should fight against the people?
#CAMERA 0
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcC 8
No. First- first the Shell must be stolen. If the Shell is gone, the lizard-people will attack the humans. The humans will become weak, the orc-orcs will drive them from the Middle Peaks.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 9
Fine, I'll steal that Shell, just don't hope I'll help you fight against the humans. After all, I'm human too.
=== briefing brief_113
About the attack on people
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show OrcPyr
#show merc2
#show Shell 5
#CAMERA 10
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Hero 1
Tyn-Acheiu, and where is the leader? I have the Shell, and from what I noticed the lizards actually became very aggressive immediately after it disappeared.
#hide Shell 5
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase OrcPyr 2
Urk-Tar has taken the warriors and gone-away. He raids the people, reclaims the encampment. You too go-go. Help!
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
Don't even think about it! After all, you're going to attack people!
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 8
#phrase OrcPyr 4
They came, they attacked-they attacked the encampment. They killed everyone. Warriors, children, old men!
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 5
Kir, do as you wish, but I will go with Urk-Tar. The Orcs have related to us very well, we should help them reclaim their lands. Furthermore, these people have simply behaved like pigs.
#ANIMATION 30
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Hero 6
Well, when you think about it, people behave like this very often. There's no surprise here. All right, we'll go together. We'll retake the camp and make sure the orcs don't become too much like humans in their bloodlust.
=== briefing brief_114
Talk to Hermit
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show IZ
#show merc2
#CAMERA 5
#ANIMATION 64
#phrase IZ 1
Man, I came here to offer you a deal.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero 2
What kind of deal?
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 5
#phrase IZ 3
I found out you were looking for this man who called himself The Chosen One. I know where he could be right now.
