Great Tka-Rick, I need to learn so many things! I have lived so long in ignorance about this! But yet I don't have time for long lectures either.
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Rick 7
You're right, you got tired of the road. Get some rest first and then tell me your story.
