=== briefing brief_121
Get acquainted with ataman
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show Karh
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Karh 1
And here are the saviors of our children! Well, finally. We've all been waiting for you! I am Bor, ataman of the Free Hunters. This is our camp. Make yourselves comfortable, make yourselves at home.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
It is a great honor for me to get to know you. I have heard a lot about the Free Hunters from the orcs. Is it true when they say that in the war between humans and orcs, you side with the orcs?
