#CAMERA 11
#phrase Karh 3
Yes and no, the people of the Village have always considered us enemies, though we have never harassed them. Well, almost never. That's why in this war we sympathize more with the orcs than the Village. But it's their war, we don't interfere.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 12
