=== briefing fq10
Talk to Ulka ( )
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Spletnica
#show merc2
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 1
It's quiet on Gipath somehow. Don't you think?
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 2
Come on! How quiet? There's so much going on here! I just found out that on the islands they keep orcs and goblins captive, and force them to work!
#ANIMATION 66
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 3
But the worst part is, they've taken Go-Go himself captive! He sits in a cage with them, like a wild animal. If Go-Go were free, he would punish those nasty orcs.
#ANIMATION 70
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 4
After all, he's so brave! So smart! He certainly became a leader for a reason, and he certainly knows how to speak beautifully. And, I'm told - not a peep from anyone - that he's insanely pretty, for a goblin.
#ANIMATION 65
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 5
Too bad he's sitting in captivity, that's how I don't even get to see him.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 6
Pretty goblin? Something doesn't want me to believe that. But go and look at him.... By the way maybe we'll set him free too.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 7
Hey, wait, I need to clean up my house here!
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 12
#phrase merc2 8
You know we don't have time to help you! Hold the money.
=== briefing fq10f
Talk to Ulka ( )
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Spletnica
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Spletnica 1
Oh how good of you to come! I've heard such things! Such- !
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 10
