=== briefing fq14
On the legacy of the Joons
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Rick
#CAMERA 10
#ANIMATION 17
#phrase Hero 1
Teacher, I have been to the neglected temple of our people, but tell me, is there anything left?
#ANIMATION 66
#CAMERA 0
#phrase Rick 2
Of course there was left, young hero. The life force overflowed our people in the days of prosperity, so that we shared with Vasyak.
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
Teacher, talk about the exchange with Vasyak.
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 4
I mean, that's what it was about.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Rick 5
There's his lab, there might be something useful there, but you have to hurry and that's why you only get one try.
=== briefing fq15
Talk to Habbur
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Haburu
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 1
Elder Habbur is pleased to see a human who shares the concerns of the People of the Forest. The humans, like the snowflakes, appear to be the same at first glance, but a closer look reveals that each is different.
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
And I'm glad to have met you, Habbur. You won't believe it, but people also sometimes think that all Forest People look the same.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 3
I know, people kept me in a cage until another human freed me.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 4
They kept me in a cage? That's horrible!
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 5
What the wind has carried away won't come back, and it's not worth talking about. But what can be fixed is far more important.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 6
Where people have built many houses, and what you call manufactories, there are many dog cages in the northwest.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 7
Power and fear force the poor animals to serve. But it's inappropriate. Just as our dear unicorns come to us of their own accord, so should dogs choose their own hosts.
=== briefing fq16
Obstacle
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Haburu
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 1
You did a good deed by freeing the dogs. And now I want to tell the story that will interest you.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 2
As clear water draws a swift-legged deer to itself, so does shining metal draw a bold man to himself. Where men have built a large maisto, to the south is a small camp of men. Behind the big fence you will find a lot of shiny metal.
#ANIMATION 17
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
Behind the big fence? And the gates are there?
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 4
Where a strong tiger will not pass, a skillful and small hare may sneak through.
#ANIMATION 32
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
There go those riddles again. I wonder what metal he's talking about - gold or steel?
=== briefing fq17
Tree of life
#DESC 
#show Hero
#Show Haburu
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 1
Haburu, I managed to guess your riddle and guessed to crawl under the fence.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 2
He who can hear should be able to listen too.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
Well, that's how it goes. Otherwise, we wouldn't understand each other.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 4
It happens, but not always. You can hear but not understand. You can freeze next to fire, die of thirst next to water and starve next to food.
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
Now I don't understand you at all.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 6
Let me explain. There is a tree in the mountains where many people put on iron armor. It grows next to water, but it does not get a drop. People have tamed the water and located it in a well. But people do not think about the living tree which also needs water, like they need food.
=== briefing fq18
Country house
#DESC 
#show Hero
#Show Haburu
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 1
The warm rays of joy from meeting you would warm my soul, if only a dark cloud of anxiety did not bedevil my reason.
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
Could it be that something has happened again?
#ANIMATION 5
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 3
I just feel like the savior of the forest. I let the dogs out of their cages, I water the trees... I wonder what shook the forest to its foundations this time: a rabbit twisted its paw?
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 4
Not far from where people forcibly kept dogs, there is an animal that needs our help. It is frightened and tired.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
Well, I get it: you want me to bring this animal to you?
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 6
Yes, but it won't be easy. Just as a light breeze plays with a leaf without letting it fall to the ground, so should you push forward the frightened animal in the correct direction.
=== briefing fq19
Wandering in the dark
#DESC 
#show Hero
#show Haburu
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 1
Your help is priceless, man. I can repay you by entrusting you with a secret I know.
#ANIMATION 12
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
If it will benefit me, that would be pretty good.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 3
Where people have dug deep burrows in the mountains, I saw one man drop this key. It is very important, as is the man who lost it. The man was so weak that he wobbled when he walked, but he tried to hold on, so he kept singing all this time.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Haburu 4
And when he fell and could not get up for a long time, his friends came and took care of him by carrying him in their arms. And that's when he lost that key. I'm sure this key is from something secret.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 5
I hope this turns out to be true. Thank you, Habbur, for the key. I will dutifully look for the lock that it opens.
=== briefing fq20
Wandering in the dark
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#Show Junofil
#ANIMATION 59
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Junofil 1
My young friend, I see great pain in you. I feel that something has happened.... where is your companion?
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
I was blind! She loved me, but I didn't notice my happiness! Kiel died when we went to get Tai-Illara's stuff!
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Junofil 3
It's sad, but there's something to be done for your pain...
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 4
How! I'm willing to give my life and everything else just to keep Kiel alive!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Junofil 5
I feel that you have three parts of a powerful artifact - the Staff of Life. If you combine them properly, we can resurrect your love.
=== briefing fq21
Wandering in the dark
#DESC 
#show Hero 
#show merc2
